P6a probe patch, based on common-c f900dd4.
Refines P6A_NOTES Appendix A: reset negotiation snapshots on each attempt;
add a read-only negotiated-state API; remove implicit startup mouse movement.
No dependency originals are edited. Strict encryption and split transport remain
opt-in SERVER_INFORMATION fields; relay address/port are independent of UDP.

